                            "playtime_at_review": 323,
                            "last_played": 1778639165
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Recommended for fans of VNs and card games, and fans of the Planet Stronghold series. Great characters, variety of aliens, and good worldbuilding as well as some impactful choices and optional romances. Choice of male or female lead and either manga or 'realistic' artstyles which you can see in the store page images. Well worth it on sale but I'd recommend checking out the main games first as they have more depth and backstory. \n\nUnlocking cards over the course of the game is good, but many missions limit your deck to only 10-15 cards and all the higher tier cards use the same resource which isn't always available, so you still have to mostly rely on the same/starting cards throughout the whole game.",
